# Storm, Windrider: "those creatures" are found exactly from the cast's own records. Danitha ("triggers only once each turn")
# records her triggering between the Giant Growth's SpellCast and its targets, so a reader that stops at the first foreign
# record loses them. Mana Leak counters the Growth (Bot1 declines to pay) before Storm's trigger resolves, and Danitha still
# gains flying.

